  "checked_claims": [
    "The attaching degree three gives d2=[3], H1=Z/3, and zero H2; reversing the 2-cell orientation changes only the sign of the column.",
    "The three exact q3 preimages and their positive local signs sum to the global degree three.",
    "Signed exponent sums, rather than unsigned letter counts, give the zero cellular boundary for the minimal torus CW structure and hence homology Z, Z^2, Z.",
